"published_on":"2014-12","url":"https://literacy.utaipei.edu.tw/var/file/65/1065/img/1007/256705145.pdf","page":"121","scope":"regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"研究第121頁明列建元二年為前139年；同一建元紀年元年暫換前140年、六年前135年。只記年對照，不推公曆月日或驗證研究中的月朔改讀。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}},"end":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"deposition","date_expression":"建元六年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p009","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":135,"year":-134,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"武安侯雖不任職，以王太后故，親幸，數言事多效，天下吏士趨勢利者，皆去魏其歸武安，武安日益橫。建元六年，竇太后崩，丞相昌、御史大夫青翟坐喪事不辦，免。以武安侯蚡為丞相，以大司農韓安國為御史大夫。天下士郡諸侯愈益附武安。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p009","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"references":[{"title":"漢初月朔考索──以出土簡牘為線索","author":"許名瑲","publication":"北市大語文學報","issue":12,"published_on":"2014-12","url":"https://literacy.utaipei.edu.tw/var/file/65/1065/img/1007/256705145.pdf","page":"121","scope":"regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"研究第121頁明列建元二年為前139年；同一建元紀年元年暫換前140年、六年前135年。只記年對照，不推公曆月日或驗證研究中的月朔改讀。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}},"interpretation_note":"按明示拜、為、免、罷逐與坐法去官區分授任與終點。既任官只作來源用稱；職位轉移不另補前官終止日。數月、數歲保留相對表述，不推具體年。太仆保留數位見證字形。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji107-037","person_id":"jex_mvs_w6d","title":"柏至侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/107.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji107-037:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p008","start":191,"end":194,"surface":"柏至侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-107-